{"id":"grob","lemma":"grob","pos":"adj","rank":3798,"glosses":["coarse, rough","uncouth, rude, crude, ill-defined"],"ipa":"/ɡʁoːp/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/60/De-grob.ogg/De-grob.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"gröber","superlative":"am gröbsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Sei nicht so grob!","en":"Don't be a brute.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Es tut mir leid, dass ich so grob war.","en":"I'm sorry I was so rude.","words":[null,null,null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"}],"phrases":[[0,4,"Sorry."]]},{"text":"Er war unhöflich, um nicht zu sagen, grob.","en":"He was impolite, not to say rude.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"rude"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},null]},{"text":"Die Methode war grob, aber wirkungsvoll.","en":"The method was crude but effective.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"manner"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"effective, impactful"}]},{"text":"Behandle die Werkzeuge nicht grob.","en":"Don't handle these tools roughly.","words":[{"g":"to treat","l":"behandeln"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"tool","l":"Werkzeug"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}